    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Text Detection Provider**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Vision AI as the text detection provider for the Python script. I'm focusing now on the initial setup and integration. My next steps involve creating the script file and establishing the connection to the Google Cloud service.\n\n\n**Implementing Text Detection Logic**\n\nI'm now in the process of building the `detect_image_text.py` file. I'm focusing on incorporating the Google Cloud Vision AI client. The script will take an image path as an argument. The next step is writing the text detection function with proper error handling.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789859856149,
          "start": 1789859854244
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbf5f7a4001pLtcAVcjSm4qaw",
